{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "595c15c2fd51",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-30T15:37:15Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/query-claims-in-natural-language-with-amazon-bedrock-knowledge-bases/",
  "sourceTitle": "Query claims in natural language with Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases",
  "sourceBodyHash": "699f67c62fbab5555cfe6ddc5eb758a751eee6e0b35079595e2c7f94859d8f57",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-02T03:40:14.412150Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-02T04:15:19.528387Z",
  "totalBlocks": 129,
  "translatedBlocks": 83,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8e9d250915bf79f",
      "translationZh": "索赔答案分散在理赔员日志条目、维修估价、警察报告、付款账簿和扫描附件中，而不是集中在一个可搜索字段。保单持有人可能会询问索赔是否获批，而理赔员可能需要查找上个月所有超过 10,000 的开放汽车索赔。这两项任务都需要快速且准确地查找并组合证据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10c651e7e7c54b34",
      "translationZh": "检索增强生成（RAG）利用检索到的文档来为模型响应提供依据。Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 是文档的完全托管型 RAG 能力。Amazon Bedrock 负责解析、分块、嵌入和向量存储，因此您可以构建一个对话界面，从索赔文件中返回带引用的答案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ece8e8e1c39e21f3",
      "translationZh": "本技术操作指南使用合成索赔记录，且未描述生产客户部署。您可以通过完成以下步骤来构建一个索赔助手，该助手能够以自然语言回答问题并提供引用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ae30a401ae616a0",
      "translationZh": "从 Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）摄取索赔文档及其元数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "667a42c7fef9710c",
      "translationZh": "使用 AgenticRetrieveStream API 以自然语言查询它们。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0244d2fd82d4f4e",
      "translationZh": "提出多轮后续问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d649b5e9b09743f",
      "translationZh": "使用诸如索赔 ID 和索赔类型等属性的元数据过滤器来限定检索范围。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8ad0a7efa59a7ac",
      "translationZh": "添加上下文 grounding 防护栏，以使答案与记录保持关联。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "74d4a68e2393ff3b",
      "translationZh": "理赔查询挑战",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5eaefb9c20b1305",
      "translationZh": "保单持有人、联络中心坐席和理赔员提出的问题各不相同：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ed5975d39ecd4d7",
      "translationZh": "保单持有人要求用 plain-language 状态更新：“估算对于索赔 CLM-100482 是否已获批准，以及支票何时会发出？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d06f20692ff409a",
      "translationZh": "联络中心坐席需要在客户等待时给出快速、准确的答案，且不转接电话。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0ff52c610c928f2",
      "translationZh": "理赔员会提出跨索赔的多部分问题，例如：上个月提交的金额超过 10,000 的未结汽车索赔有哪些，以及每项仍有哪些工作未完成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03bdc6116e175034",
      "translationZh": "答案存储在 PDF 理赔员报告、Word 通信和文本笔记中，而不是存储在一致的数据库字段中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "558225a85c38d300",
      "translationZh": "记录可能相互冲突或取代早期版本。修订后的估算可以取代早期估算，或临时付款可能后来被撤销。助手必须确定哪个估算、付款或状态具有控制力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "497015f527c8c0f5",
      "translationZh": "由于索赔受到监管，每个答案必须基于源文档并包含引用。联络中心坐席在重复答案前可以核实来源，主管可以审计助手是如何得出该答案的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b1c2e67ccdb2319",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案使用 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 将来自 Amazon S3 的索赔文档编入索引以供检索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30e0f0830b046c1b",
      "translationZh": "通过 AgenticRetrieveStream 进行的代理检索会制定答案，将多部分问题拆分为子查询，并执行一次或多次检索过程。在生成响应之前，它会检查证据是否充足。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ede995861bd612ec",
      "translationZh": "该 API 会流式传输追踪事件、答案文本和引用。追踪事件会暴露检索计划，而每个引用会将答案的一部分映射到源索赔文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5e31bbe2ba15c72",
      "translationZh": "以下图示展示了两条路径。摄入通道将索赔文档及其元数据加载到知识库中。检索通道在返回带引用的答案之前，会将每个问题通过 AgenticRetrieveStream 和 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 基础检查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86466817a8af60c4",
      "translationZh": "图 1：基于 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 的对话式索赔助手",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3bfc7a96e60acb6",
      "translationZh": "摄入通道在文档到达时运行：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "944f551af1c16334",
      "translationZh": "PDF、Word 或文本格式的索赔文档随匹配的元数据侧车文件一起落地到 Amazon S3。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd27637f4aa37bc2",
      "translationZh": "摄入作业会在文档变更时将 S3 数据源与知识库同步。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1de763d788ac7552",
      "translationZh": "知识库解析、分块、嵌入并为文档及其元数据在托管向量存储中建立索引。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4929af31c1271648",
      "translationZh": "检索通道为每个问题运行：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6c2d1c2d81db4d1",
      "translationZh": "应用程序使用问题、对话历史以及可选的元数据过滤器（用于限定搜索范围）调用 AgenticRetrieveStream。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e83a3a3e9162b0f6",
      "translationZh": "基础模型生成子查询并重复检索，直至获得足够证据，最多进行 maxAgentIteration 轮。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa37d12af1e09f36",
      "translationZh": "上下文基础检查会阻止那些未被检索记录支持的答案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "608ec3e5cc54d0e8",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 会流式传输答案、追踪事件和引用，以便应用程序可以在数据到达时实时显示输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d960a4efc16e0ac",
      "translationZh": "在开始之前，请确认您具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04b3d083f127fe51",
      "translationZh": "具备拥有 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon S3 的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 权限的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2934fc324ee58f78",
      "translationZh": "通过 Amazon Bedrock 模型访问获得的基础模型（FM）访问权限。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34ac0f008474d105",
      "translationZh": "一个支持所选基础模型和 Amazon Bedrock 知识库的 AWS 区域。本演练使用美国西部（俄勒冈），us-west-2。部署前请查看 Amazon Bedrock 中按 AWS 区域列出的受支持模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eea76cae8dc49412",
      "translationZh": "此处使用的 AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) 已配置凭据和支持所用 API 的版本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04b54b21e14ad2dc",
      "translationZh": "用于存储合成索赔文档和元数据的 S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1fbf55c192f150d",
      "translationZh": "熟悉 Python 和基本的 RAG 概念。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0936e8ff289057b3",
      "translationZh": "准备索赔文档和元数据",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "395149b08712493e",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon S3 中为每份索赔存储一份文档。知识库可直接读取 PDF 理赔报告、Word 通信和文本笔记，因此您可以保持文档的原始格式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "091511bd7dbbad66",
      "translationZh": "图 2 显示了一份合成索赔记录。当前敞口是估算的总索赔成本。其证据索引标识了一份被取代的传真草稿，即被较新版本取代的记录。元数据侧车重复了助手可以过滤的字段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf08cf22146a3c2b",
      "translationZh": "图 2：带有文件控制字段和证据索引的合成索赔记录",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd682103ca16d2c5",
      "translationZh": "为了过滤，添加一个与原文件同名并带有 .metadata.json 后缀的伴随元数据文件。对于 CLM-100482.pdf，使用 CLM-100482.pdf.metadata.json。代位求偿是保险公司从责任第三方追回成本的努力。以下示例描述了一起汽车索赔。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4c29794447e7805",
      "translationZh": "边车包含标量字符串、数字和布尔值。值类型决定可用的过滤器。以下表格列出了后续查询中使用的字段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5555bfbdba9a2a71",
      "translationZh": "本文使用合成数据。在未获得所需控制和批准的情况下，请不要在这些资源中放置真实的个人身份信息（PII）或受保护的健康信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a4f9cacd81617a2",
      "translationZh": "等于用于单个索赔查找",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7c094ba0afad961",
      "translationZh": "等于或 in 用于业务线",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "546f25bbd71211b6",
      "translationZh": "in 用于活跃工作队列",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d9b0d60363660c3",
      "translationZh": "数值范围比较",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecbe7bda38aac331",
      "translationZh": "以 YYYYMMDD 整数表示的日期范围",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fa27da7174d3807",
      "translationZh": "从会话中获取的租户范围",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c324eb9514966757",
      "translationZh": "从会话中获取的客户范围",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29c6d0dffd3a9704",
      "translationZh": "用于恢复工作的等于",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9e02f9073e38af6",
      "translationZh": "将日期存储为 YYYYMMDD 整数，因为元数据过滤器比较数字而不是日期字符串。此格式支持诸如“上月提交”之类的范围。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ec36461873f7edb",
      "translationZh": "仅在 amount 中存储一个可比较的货币值。准备金是为估算的索赔成本而预留的资金，而冻结是暂时扣留的。将准备金、付款和冻结保存在文档文本中，以保持其标签清晰。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd70adbe8f0be2ac",
      "translationZh": "Sidecar 文件大小限制为 10 KB。有关完整格式，请参阅将 Amazon S3 连接到您的知识库。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3065754ad5363b34",
      "translationZh": "S3 布局将每个索赔文档与其元数据文件配对：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ff8f88dd95403d36",
      "translationZh": "创建托管知识库并摄取声明",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19dc59a1b04e41c0",
      "translationZh": "使用 bedrock-agent 客户端创建知识库。将 knowledgeBaseConfiguration.type 和 embeddingModelType 设置为 MANAGED。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c653ba1ac9d22d4c",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 负责选择和运行嵌入模型。无需配置向量存储。有关所有参数，请参阅 CreateKnowledgeBase。以下代码用于创建知识库：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "112d5960d8b9c175",
      "translationZh": "roleArn 服务角色授予知识库读取 S3 存储桶和使用托管嵌入模型的权限。请参阅“为 Amazon Bedrock 知识库创建服务角色”。若要使用客户管理的 AWS 密钥管理服务 (AWS KMS) 密钥对托管向量存储进行加密，请在 serverSideEncryptionConfiguration 中传入其 ARN。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79eb134d27527715",
      "translationZh": "接下来，将 S3 存储桶连接为数据源。inclusionPrefixes 设置将摄取限制为 claims/：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9680c7835ff53d66",
      "translationZh": "启动摄取任务以解析、分块、嵌入并索引文档。每当索赔文档被添加或更新时，请再次运行该任务，以确保索引保持同步：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d79715b89c496e1",
      "translationZh": "使用 get_ingestion_job 或 Amazon Bedrock 控制台检查状态。当作业完成后，声明即可被搜索。有关详细信息，请参阅 StartIngestionJob。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "424840e2cca65759",
      "translationZh": "使用 AgenticRetrieveStream API 查询声明",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "921f30e0ff0969cb",
      "translationZh": "在声明被摄取后，使用 bedrock-agent-runtime 客户端调用 AgenticRetrieveStream。完整的请求和响应语法请参阅 API 参考。该请求包含三个部分：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ddb54ec389ccfb3c",
      "translationZh": "messages：对话轮次。每条消息具有 user 或 assistant 角色，并包含一个 content.text 值。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9d12caa1d0f16d0",
      "translationZh": "检索器：最多五个知识库。每个知识库包含一个知识库 ID，并可指定元数据过滤器和 maxNumberOfResults（1–100）。对于涉及多个声明的问题，请提高此限制。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b15d01dada35ca19",
      "translationZh": "agenticRetrieveConfiguration：规划模型和迭代次数限制。使用 MANAGED 以采用服务模型。若要使用特定模型，请使用 CUSTOM 并指定模型 ARN。maxAgentIteration 用于限制规划和检索轮次的数量。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71bd6e9b06b77360",
      "translationZh": "此请求用于查询某项声明的状态。将 generateResponse 设置为 True 将返回自然语言答案：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c1bc9094e117633",
      "translationZh": "遍历 response[“stream”] 并处理这三种事件类型：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11899dbb8813496b",
      "translationZh": "traceEvent：报告每个步骤的规划、检索、全文扩展、护栏操作、状态以及生成的子查询。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9eb79ff5e946251",
      "translationZh": "responseEvent：提供可流式传输给用户的增量回答文本。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff8aa2e1d1c77303",
      "translationZh": "result：包含去重后的检索结果，以及当 generateResponse 为 True 时，完整的生成答案及其引用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e376ef161032d7c",
      "translationZh": "以下循环会在答案块到达时进行流式传输，并保留最终结果以供引用渲染：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "999326881fe22c15",
      "translationZh": "阅读追踪以查看计划",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15b05f133c22f8e2",
      "translationZh": "基本循环会打印每一步及其状态。此辅助函数还会打印子查询、完整文档获取以及护栏操作：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eef75ede74358246",
      "translationZh": "图3展示了智能体循环。该服务会规划策略、创建子查询、检索证据，并检查是否已获取足够信息。如有必要，它会再执行一轮处理，然后生成带有引用的答案。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a76c250e173ad37a",
      "translationZh": "图 3：从问题到引用答案的智能体检索循环",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fb1cdaa612948e0",
      "translationZh": "每个引用都标识了答案中的一个字符范围，并引用结果事件 results 数组中的支持条目。应用程序使用这些索引将显示的文本与其源文档关联起来。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56506c4275d532e0",
      "translationZh": "以下代码会在其源文档的内置 x-amz-bedrock-kb-source-uri 值旁边打印每个被引用的片段：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a4a1c7312f1fd6d",
      "translationZh": "在多轮对话中提出后续问题",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4593dff522e6eca2",
      "translationZh": "后续问题取决于之前的对话轮次。在状态回答之后，投保人可能会问：“谁是被指派处理它的理赔员？”单词“it”是从传入 messages 的对话历史中解析出来的。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da19fbbcf4325d9a",
      "translationZh": "将对话保留在应用程序中。在每一轮交互后，追加用户的问题和助手的回答，然后在下次调用时发送完整的列表：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
